{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"耶利米書","commonName":"耶利米書","title":"耶利米書","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"681b5a173916e28ae5f3b5c6bb5d16263b7d167f21a486ef3c62ed1ab29150f3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":47,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["關於非利士的預言"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["在法老攻打迦薩之前，耶和華告訴了耶利米先知有關非利士人的事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「看啊，大水將從北方漲溢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"形成一道氾濫的洪流，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"淹沒大地和地上的一切，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吞噬城邑和其中的居民。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人們必呼喊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地上的居民都必哀哭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一聽見敵軍馬蹄噠噠、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"戰車隆隆、車輪滾滾的聲音，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"做父親的就手腳發軟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無力回頭照顧兒女。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為毀滅所有非利士人的日子到了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"剷除泰爾和西頓剩餘幫手的日子到了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華要滅絕迦斐托島剩餘的非利士人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"迦薩一片淒涼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亞實基倫淪為廢墟。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谷中的餘民啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要割傷身體到何時呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們大喊，『耶和華的刀啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你何時才停下來呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你入鞘吧！停下來吧！』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但耶和華已命令它攻擊亞實基倫和沿海一帶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它怎能停下來呢？」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/47.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/48.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/46.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}